msgid "The post type and status every new entry is published with."
msgstr "نوع المحتوى والحالة اللذان يُنشر بهما كل مُدخَل جديد."

#: includes/campaigns_list_help.php:29
msgid ""
"Useful when add-ons give you more campaign types. You can hide this column "
"in Screen Options."
